    "1778843499df5a6469": {
      "type": "_blocks",
      "blocks": {
        "ai_gen_block_d9dab0a_d6LjbG": {
          "type": "ai_gen_block_d9dab0a",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "container_width": 1200,
            "left_column_width": 40,
            "right_column_width": 60,
            "column_gap": 40,
            "desktop_width_percent": 100,
            "heading": "What makes us different from the other lot",
            "heading_font": "serif",
            "heading_size": 56,
            "mobile_heading_size": 40,
            "heading_color": "#121212",
            "heading_indent": 25,
            "mobile_heading_indent": 40,
            "image_max_width": 600,
            "heading_image_gap": 4,
            "mobile_heading_image_gap": 25,
            "body_text": "<p>Scentspired creates luxury inspired perfumes. Each one is developed to capture the essence of a designer fragrance you already know, using high-quality fragrance oils that perform at the level you expect. Not something that smells roughly similar on the first spray and then disappears by lunch. Something you reach for because it works, lasts, and costs about £15.99. The idea being that you can actually wear it. Every day. Without keeping a tally.</p><p>We also believe that incredible scent should not be a privilege. It should be accessible to anyone who wants to feel something when they walk into a room, whatever their budget happens to be. That is the whole point of what we do.</p>",
            "body_font": "system_ui_n4",
            "body_size": 32,
            "mobile_body_size": 16,
            "body_color": "#111111",
            "paragraph_spacing": 30,
